---
const TAGS = ["Research", "Interaction design", "Prototyping", "Design systems", "Framer", "Workshops"];
---

<section data-framer-name="03 About" class="px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[420px_1fr]">
    <div class="relative">
      <img
        src="/images/EyNglsC5qO5YzdL87lJoka3is2g.18a4a304.jpg"
        alt="At the desk, sketching on a tablet"
        class="aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover"
      />
      <span class="absolute -bottom-3 left-4 rounded-full bg-ink px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white shadow-lg">
        Mara · dragging
      </span>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium">
        <span class="text-accent">[03]</span> <span class="text-ink/40">ABOUT</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-[36px] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink md:text-[42px]">
        I've spent nine years{" "}
        <span class="relative inline-block rounded border border-accent px-1">untangling</span> the software
        people use at work, for{" "}
        <span class="rounded bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-accent">
          <span aria-hidden="true">◇</span> 4.2M people
        </span>{" "}
        a month: payroll, physio bookings, furniture and mountain huts.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <p class="text-ink/70">
          I start where the problem happens: on the reception desk, in the pay run, at the trailhead. Then I
          design the fewest decisions that get someone from stuck to done, and I stay until it ships.
        </p>
        <p class="text-ink/70">
          Before going independent I designed at Fietsbank and Harbour Labs. Today I lead design at Orrin and
          take one outside project at a time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-t border-ink/10 pt-6 text-sm">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-ink/40">Based in</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-ink">Rotterdam, NL</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-ink/40">Working with</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-ink">Teams of 5 to 5,000</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-ink/40">Languages</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-ink">English, Dutch, German</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {TAGS.map((tag) => (
          <span class="rounded-full bg-ink/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink/70">
            {tag}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>

      <a href="/about" class="mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-ink underline">
        More about me →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
